best advice: upgrade to nh3.0g5+. you can't get Stormbringer in nh2.2.
you can get a few named weapons like Snickersnee (katana), Orcrist (2sword)
and Excalibur, i think. with the exception of Excalibur named weapons are
obtained by "naming" them using the "c" command. Excalibur requires
that you have a long sword and a fateful encounter with the lady of the
lake, (i.e. dip the sword), i think, it has been awhile ...

[rwilley@eagle.wesleyan.edu writes:]
>how much [disk]space does net hack 3.0 need.
You can build the playground in as little as 3M of disk space on a unix
system but 5M is more comfortable. having built the game you only need
approximately 1M of space for each player and 1M for the playground.
the game doesn't appear to be a serious cpu hog so that shouldn't
matter to you. pc builds may be different ...

